Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,On this long journey that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,we've only barely begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendship, love, courage,\Nand a little bit of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the things!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That even as the years go by!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.46,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Will not ever vanish from our minds!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We are all pieces of\Na single planet Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Little by little we can\Nfind each other's worth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we see what sort of\Nform we're meant to take!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:01:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us know the wind will\Nalways keep on blowing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,As you finish what you've begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.50,0:01:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look through that wind to dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.58,0:01:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears as you're bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.26,0:01:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The things you must overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.18,0:01:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Found in meeting somebody new!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.70,0:01:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.94,0:01:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.86,0:01:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed will help\Nyou to become so much stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.94,0:01:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed\Nwill help you to remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything, everything, everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now and forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.74,0:01:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you\Nas you finish what you've begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do that. Wind to\Ndry all the tears as
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.78,0:02:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you're plating the\Nthings you must overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure,\Nfound in meeting somebody new!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.32,0:02:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.92,0:02:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And this washed-up\Nformer warlord over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.24,0:02:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean you, Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.40,0:02:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you got your ass handed to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.52,0:02:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't know Straw Hat\NLuffy was the one to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.56,0:02:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Funny thing is!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.78,0:02:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trying to take Crocodile's\Nplace as a warlord at the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.20,0:02:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So killing you was about the\Nbest way I could think of!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.06,0:02:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,to show the government I\Nwas worthy of the position.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard's days are\Nnumbered and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.98,0:03:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates. First,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.90,0:03:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm headed off to Water\N7 to kill Straw Hat
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.24,0:03:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy as a special gift\Nto the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.18,0:03:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't hurt to have\Nyou along for the fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.46,0:03:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.37,0:03:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I know him, you sack of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.12,0:03:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let you\Nkill my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.74,0:03:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet here you are
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.36,0:03:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Fate decided to save you instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.34,0:03:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace had been chasing after\Nme to get revenge for my so
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.38,0:03:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Called crime on Whitener's\Nship. And I had been chasing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.86,0:03:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,you Of course I couldn't team\Nup with him to kill you But
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,it all worked out Because we\Nboth got the fight we wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.70,0:03:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Henry ate it. If he'd let\Nus get away, he'd not only
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.84,0:03:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,disgrace Whitebeard's name\NBut he'd also be turning his
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,back on his brother And\Nleaving you to die There is no
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:04:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,such thing as coincidence\NWhen it comes to fate Truly
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.78,0:04:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and you god lucky kiddo\NYou weren't fated to die
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.64,0:04:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Our captain achieved his goal\Nof becoming a warlord Thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.66,0:04:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,to your brother So you're\Nthoroughly useless to us now
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.44,0:04:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wee ha ha
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.32,0:04:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ole's put up a brave fight And\Nit just didn't work out for him
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.32,0:04:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Better make sure you pay your\Nhumble respects At his grave strike
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.50,0:04:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He went and took your place\Nfor you Because if it weren't
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,For your brother, you'd be\Ndead and he'd be walking free.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.40,0:04:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to kill me now! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.48,0:04:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let my brother die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.70,0:05:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.09,0:05:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The Black Vortex!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.74,0:05:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord, I thought it was made of rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.56,0:05:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even realize what\Nthe hell I just did, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.18,0:05:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how I broke your\Nmiserable brother! Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.64,0:06:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,just like him, your devil-proof powers are\Nabout as useless as money to a dickman!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.98,0:06:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that matters?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, that's enough. Calm yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go, David.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.52,0:06:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.50,0:06:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Take one. Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop and listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.46,0:06:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your objective here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.48,0:06:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Is fighting going to\Nhelp you accomplish it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I've known him,\NTeach has always been a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.80,0:06:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when he was a nobody\Non Whitebeard's crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where the\NCretan got his powers from,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but not even your invincible\Nbrother was strong
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,enough to overcome that\Nterrifying darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.98,0:06:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pointless for you to waste\Nyour time and energy fighting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:06:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and it sure as hell's not\Ngoing to do Ace any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't save your brother\Nif you get yourself killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're stronger than\NI expected, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You got more Haki than you did last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your name is Blackbeard. You said.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're the nameless pirate\NI've heard so much about the one
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,who was part of Whitebeard's crew\Nuntil he took my place as warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.62,0:07:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is rather odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely they summoned you to Navy\Nheadquarters for the execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's clear enough how much you\Ncoveted the title of warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.10,0:07:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So why would you risk losing\Nit to come to this dump?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all a part of my grand scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're that interested, I\Nsuppose I can lay it out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.64,0:07:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what you want, Mr. Crocodile?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.90,0:07:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I couldn't care less.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.40,0:07:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a heart made of ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.02,0:07:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This one does.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.14,0:08:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.98,0:08:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.14,0:08:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden Magellan is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.14,0:08:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There goes the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Boy, you gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't take the risk of\NMagellan poisoning you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.26,0:08:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You were lucky the first time around,\Nbut you won't survive another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna be here any second!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.12,0:08:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.03,0:08:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.12,0:08:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden Magellan's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.90,0:08:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.86,0:08:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're finally saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.16,0:08:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Magellan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.07,0:08:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So I finally get to meet the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.52,0:08:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Head up the stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The mazooka troops have cleared out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.00,0:08:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing in our way now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.44,0:08:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.80,0:08:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and hit those stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.36,0:08:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to level three, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.36,0:08:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We appreciate you scattering\Ntheir defense on the staircase.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.26,0:08:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I must at least give you your due.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,On that one you helped us out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.34,0:09:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You know this would have been\Na hell of a lot harder without?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.74,0:09:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,about the panic you caused!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.40,0:09:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.31,0:09:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a straight shot to level three!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.10,0:09:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Freedom, here we come!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.42,0:09:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, I'll take another\Nfrickin' demon guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.74,0:09:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Minotaurus this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Minotaurus?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.86,0:09:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have swore that we already beat him\Ninto a massive mound of hamburger patty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't really matter if you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.46,0:09:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Each one of them has awakened\NZoan-type Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.36,0:09:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They were already strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.96,0:09:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they're practically invulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.82,0:09:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.73,0:10:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.70,0:10:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Those monsters ain't a Devil Fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows how little time we've\Ngot before the other three recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.50,0:10:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, if you're gonna piss your\Npants, don't waste it on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we've already got the\Nboss of hell hot on our tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.74,0:10:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden Magellan, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.28,0:10:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I just received a report that Blackbeard\Nhas already infiltrated this floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.84,0:10:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's at the staircase\Nto level three as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.06,0:10:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I put that lunatic sheet of you\Nin charge of holding them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Was he defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.52,0:10:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the monitoring room. What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.50,0:10:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a problem, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.18,0:10:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We've lost the visual feed\Nin all of our monitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.74,0:10:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone broke the vision\Nreceiver transponder snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.62,0:10:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And if that wasn't already bad enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.16,0:10:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,all communication channels\Nto Navy HQ have been cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.32,0:10:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So we can't even contact...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.10,0:10:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:10:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.84,0:11:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Keep talking! What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.76,0:11:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know who's behind the blackout?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't have you blowing my cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.22,0:11:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I want this to be a\Nsurprise for the boss man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.88,0:11:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We've lost communication\Nwith communications!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Get someone up there to\Nfind out what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.66,0:11:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.57,0:11:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It just keeps getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.16,0:11:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way Blackbeard could\Nhave made it to this floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.38,0:11:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is if he overcame the toxic blockades.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.08,0:11:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I placed over the exits on level two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.04,0:11:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And that would make level two defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.48,0:11:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,None of our plans are working.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.64,0:11:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We were careless enough to\Nlet a single rat stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And now we're up to our necks in vermin.\NBuggy! Mr. Three! Buggy! Mr. Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.54,0:11:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Make way for genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.14,0:11:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We fought by killing, here we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.26,0:11:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Level one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.48,0:12:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to get to feel the sun on\Nour skin, and who do we have to thank?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.90,0:12:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Our brave and brilliant\Nsavior, Captain Byron!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saving it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find a way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't going to stop you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.80,0:12:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You give it your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.32,0:12:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing's impossible in this world, after\Nall, but I've already told you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.64,0:12:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember Sky Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.32,0:12:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The era when pirates' dream of\Ntreasure will come to an end?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.66,0:12:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The dreams of pirates will never end!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.78,0:12:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.28,0:12:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like Sky Island, the\NOne Piece is really out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.82,0:13:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait for you to see\Nwhat we've got in store.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.34,0:13:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you're gonna be impressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.28,0:13:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,In a few hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.38,0:13:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,we're gonna put on a show so explosive\Nthat'll shake the whole damn world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.76,0:13:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignore him, Luffy, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.90,0:13:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep moving boys straight to level three.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.68,0:13:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you please get me down from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.10,0:13:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop staring you creeps!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.52,0:13:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what happened to you, Sadie?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.66,0:13:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That damn Yvonne cough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.12,0:13:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat me and tied me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.04,0:13:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.40,0:13:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how humiliating it\Nis to do this to a dominatrix?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.22,0:14:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Help her, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.34,0:14:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to deal with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.26,0:14:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.17,0:14:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.70,0:14:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a funny feeling you're Magellan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.58,0:14:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm guessing you're Blackbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.02,0:14:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit the nail right on\Nthe head, pal. Hydra!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too busy trying to run this prison to\Neven bother asking what you're doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.44,0:14:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what is this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.18,0:15:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, it's gotta be some kind of poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.52,0:15:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.66,0:15:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Panyable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed with how long you held out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.74,0:15:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take the rest from here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.68,0:15:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the Vice Warden all right, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.62,0:15:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, he looks terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.24,0:15:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit gawking and help him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.62,0:15:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.40,0:15:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Warden, just hang in there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.10,0:15:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.18,0:15:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't die, Hannibal?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only one who\Ncan possibly take my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.34,0:15:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, how the hell could you\Npossibly survive after I poisoned you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.94,0:16:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt that he's the\None who caused all this mayhem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.58,0:16:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The next chance I get, nothing\Nwill stop me from taking his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.80,0:16:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that Magellan's coming? That\Ncame from the foot of the stairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all dead who catches\Nup to us the poison guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.24,0:16:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you this, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.76,0:16:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You will never escape this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.24,0:17:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running, trust me, you\Ndon't want to look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.42,0:17:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't escape from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.34,0:17:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.46,0:17:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the last group.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else who was behind\Nthem is no longer standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.22,0:17:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.42,0:17:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Inazuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.82,0:17:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.10,0:17:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Great scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.62,0:18:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Inazuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.02,0:18:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you just cut the staircase\NEva hasn't come up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.16,0:18:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All you need to worry about\Nis getting out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.54,0:18:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do that. You said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.62,0:18:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you hoping to accomplish?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.62,0:18:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Curious, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.50,0:18:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't figure it out,\Nyou must be terribly slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.04,0:19:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.54,0:19:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What I meant to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.96,0:19:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that your stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.34,0:19:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.82,0:19:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.73,0:19:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,you do buy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.29,0:19:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,yourself some time,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.21,0:19:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat and his little friend still\Nhave no means of escape. By some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.12,0:19:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, how cheeky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.08,0:19:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Already convinced you\Ncan beat me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.42,0:19:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamabaka style.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.82,0:19:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,New Kamakenpo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.40,0:19:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Feast your eyes on this Drop boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.42,0:20:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.20,0:20:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Freedom's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.84,0:20:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Captain Boogie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.22,0:20:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a weapon and do your\Npart. There you go. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.64,0:20:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.36,0:20:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,After a stroke of luck allowed\Nthem to escape from level two,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,which had been blocked\Nby Magellan's poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.72,0:20:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.20,0:20:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, and the others are\Nclosing in on the main entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.90,0:20:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They are now on level one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.52,0:20:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Led by Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.72,0:20:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the mob of newcomers\Nand the prisoners they
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.48,0:20:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,freed continue their\Nascent through Impel Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.96,0:20:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Running through level four and three,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They've now made their way to\NLevel Two, the Wild Beast Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.82,0:20:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,where they've found\Nsurprisingly little resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.02,0:20:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.93,0:20:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ivankov has put a temporary\Nhalt to Warden Magellan's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.94,0:20:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,poisonous pursuit by doing\Nbattle with him on level three.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.06,0:21:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Ivankov.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.96,0:21:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.10,0:21:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,After them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.46,0:21:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Earn your feet, or I'm going to\Nslap them beating out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.76,0:21:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite their repeated defeats.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.04,0:21:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadie has used a unique\Nbrand of motivation!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.50,0:21:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,To coax the demon guards into another\Nbattle on level one, jail manager Shit
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.32,0:21:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you who is now Running wild cut all\Nlines of communication with the outside
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.26,0:21:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,world so that no one could discover\NThis situation within the prison and so
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.54,0:22:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,the unprecedented events happen one after\Nanother Literally behind closed doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.28,0:22:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately for us impel town\Nis surrounded by prison ships?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.84,0:22:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and Navy ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.32,0:22:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If we could somehow manage\Nto steal one of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.14,0:22:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,we could use a ticket to Marineford?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.96,0:22:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,before Ace's execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.68,0:22:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.20,0:22:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.44,0:22:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Only four hours remain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.28,0:22:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Until Ace's public execution?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.34,0:22:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,at Navy headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.52,0:22:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Hmm. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.88,0:22:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.78,0:22:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Long on the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.32,0:22:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Shemaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.16,0:22:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, something's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.90,0:22:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the poison guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.38,0:22:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He was right behind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.60,0:22:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's no coincidence that Eva\Nand Inazuma stopped in the lower level.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.74,0:22:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.65,0:22:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They stayed behind to fight\Ntheir poison guy by themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.08,0:22:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ralphs, we need to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.38,0:23:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.38,0:23:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you pulling my tail?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.46,0:23:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't call him a\Nmiracle worker for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.10,0:23:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If he thinks he can handle the big\Nboss, then be grateful and keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.00,0:23:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ralphs and Ralphs, I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.58,0:23:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something fishy going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.84,0:23:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting through here way too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.22,0:23:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.13,0:23:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was thinking the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.12,0:23:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I don't see any\Nprisoners in the cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.90,0:23:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And all of the doors are wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.56,0:23:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone must have come through\Nand released them, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.44,0:23:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my mate!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.18,0:23:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it melting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.90,0:24:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the pain, the agony,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.54,0:24:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,oh, my beautiful face, you monster,\Nah, I was going to melt, melt,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.58,0:24:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,melt, or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.94,0:24:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, my makeup protected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.34,0:24:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.12,0:24:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, death, wink, wink, wink.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.30,0:24:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Death!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.00,0:24:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Death! Death!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.66,0:24:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Venom Blowfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.54,0:24:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.66,0:24:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why in a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.42,0:24:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My boot laces!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.44,0:24:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe not because these beauties are
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.90,0:25:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,laceless there's no\Nlaces you got me there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.56,0:25:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to gain by\Nstalling for time. Think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.98,0:25:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh but I'm having so much fun doing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.94,0:25:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine then have it your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.96,0:25:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to end this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.50,0:25:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How about right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.26,0:25:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,New Kama Kenpo 44.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.76,0:25:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Aesthetic Technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.46,0:25:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hair Removal Fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.12,0:25:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.54,0:25:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.46,0:26:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Eva.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.42,0:26:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.68,0:26:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now cave out!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.16,0:26:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to stall me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.90,0:26:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The four demon guards\Nare the ones! We screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.70,0:26:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.02,0:26:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back to yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.66,0:26:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't fight them!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.02,0:26:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole freaking up\Nthing is canceled, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.84,0:26:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's pull it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.72,0:27:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.28,0:27:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.48,0:27:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.30,0:27:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's been a while, Mr. Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.66,0:27:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you're a whimpering\Nimbecile, just like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.08,0:27:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Who in their right mind would\Nrelease this pain in the butt?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.70,0:27:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Captain Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.90,0:27:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.81,0:27:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys knocked out\Nall four demon guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.12,0:27:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wado?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.64,0:27:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's the war on team day!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.88,0:27:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.14,0:27:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,God, I'm glad you guys are okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.66,0:27:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He is too, Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.60,0:27:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it just breaks my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.64,0:27:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.84,0:27:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There are a bunch of released\Nprisoners and perverts
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.12,0:27:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,that are coming up one after\Nanother from level two!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.98,0:27:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Perverts do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.14,0:27:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.08,0:27:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling perverts?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.34,0:28:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what you two goons get\Nfor walking out on us back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.46,0:28:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.66,0:28:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Captain Buggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.88,0:28:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.06,0:28:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Those prisoners are from level four,\Nand they made it all the way up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.48,0:28:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd they get away from\NWarden Magellan?! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.96,0:28:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Two riots happened at the\Nsame time under our watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.28,0:28:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the warden now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.72,0:28:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hydra!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.22,0:28:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Magellan's here too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.82,0:28:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What is happening on this floor?! Oh crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.30,0:28:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Something bad happened\Nto even the crab guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.30,0:28:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't beat up, straw boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.20,0:28:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Running is the only option\Nwe've got with Magellan!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.24,0:29:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.64,0:29:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna run, I'm gonna kick his ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.60,0:29:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir, but are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.78,0:29:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, but that's\Nreally what you want? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.14,0:29:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Set up everything just as I've explained.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.54,0:29:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And do it as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.56,0:29:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.34,0:29:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.32,0:29:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what he's got up his sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.58,0:29:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.49,0:29:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.78,0:29:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You barely laid a finger on him last\Ntime, and you're lucky he didn't kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.58,0:29:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I'm still alive, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.74,0:29:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Miracles don't happen again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.88,0:29:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why they're miracles\Nin the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.86,0:29:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit horse-playing, you two,\Nand get to the upper level.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.02,0:29:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Luffy, we have to get to\Nthe main entrance, post-haste.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.00,0:29:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Things aren't looking good for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.94,0:29:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We were paying too much\Nattention to Magellan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.82,0:29:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hydra.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.38,0:29:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Heads up, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.36,0:30:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Candle, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.76,0:30:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.94,0:30:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He stopped telling his\Nhydra right in his tracks!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.90,0:30:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your naivety still sickens me, so\Ndon't get the wrong idea, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.04,0:30:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I may have saved your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.82,0:30:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,but that doesn't mean I want to\Nbe friends or any of that mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.06,0:30:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm just sick of owing\Nyou a damn favor, that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.60,0:30:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I like you even more now, brother three!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.30,0:30:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Devil Fruit powers, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.26,0:30:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that wax?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.20,0:30:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.28,0:30:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I ate the wax wax fruit and\Ngained these handy powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.68,0:30:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This wall might as well be made of iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.04,0:30:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can promise you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.38,0:30:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your venom is not\Ngetting through it. Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.44,0:30:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad that pile of garbage was\Ngood for something after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.70,0:31:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just goes to show that every power\Nhas a use somewhere or another. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.24,0:31:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.56,0:31:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't plan on keeping this up forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.46,0:31:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.72,0:31:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Meddlesome twit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.26,0:31:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you standing around for?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.38,0:31:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't hold much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.02,0:31:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll lead\Nthe charge out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.20,0:31:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard him, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.72,0:31:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That is super handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.62,0:31:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Outside the burning hill, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.58,0:31:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go, and I will be right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.84,0:31:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a head start and\Nclear the path for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.00,0:31:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.18,0:31:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting tired of saying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.10,0:31:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, didn't you tell me this would\Nonly work if you stole a Navy ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.06,0:31:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.16,0:31:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you go with everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.44,0:31:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to stay behind\Nand try to stop this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.22,0:31:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not going to have much chance\Nof stealing it with him chasing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.58,0:31:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be the case, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.70,0:31:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, I got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.94,0:31:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're confident in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.70,0:31:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.96,0:31:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, but don't go\Nand push yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.82,0:32:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, three. Let's get this fight going.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.28,0:32:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No hell no i don't want\Nto fight that monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.78,0:32:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to buy us some time so
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.00,0:32:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,we can run away brother\Nthree we aren't that
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.50,0:32:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,strong but we're here to help you you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.70,0:32:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,got the wrong idea that's not what i want.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.20,0:32:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Face forward dammit this is not\Nthe time to lose your focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.72,0:32:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry but my eyes keep\Nfilling up. with tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.92,0:32:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.14,0:32:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You made me into an ass-kicking machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.98,0:32:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and start fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.52,0:32:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.92,0:32:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hydra!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.20,0:32:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.16,0:32:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.96,0:32:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.80,0:32:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep trying, but you're\Nnot getting through!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.04,0:33:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Goal, Goal, Champion, Rifle!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.40,0:33:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome, I can touch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.10,0:33:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,These cannons are loaded and good to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.50,0:33:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And we've got candle shields!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.12,0:33:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.50,0:33:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We got the bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.86,0:33:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.62,0:33:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We beat all the tough guys, that\Nmeans we can finally relax a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.30,0:33:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're letting your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.52,0:34:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act like such an amateur. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.54,0:34:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Going by my last count, there are at\Nleast 10 Navy ships waiting out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.30,0:34:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And each one has 800 marines on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.34,0:34:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know their configuration,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.92,0:34:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but stealing one Navy ship\Nmeans that we're still
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.20,0:34:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna have to contend with\Nthe rest of the fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.44,0:34:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that sound relaxing to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.04,0:34:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you've got a point there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.00,0:34:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's not the only problem we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.24,0:34:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no more guards\Nto get in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.90,0:34:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's left now is the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.58,0:34:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.84,0:34:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready your weapons, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.80,0:34:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to open this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.70,0:34:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.82,0:34:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And push.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.06,0:34:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've finally got to get\Nto go home. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.22,0:35:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not done yet, so don't jinx it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.36,0:35:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one last giant hurdle\Nwaiting for us out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.18,0:35:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A whole Navy fleet, so\Nwe got a ways to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.46,0:35:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.98,0:35:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can chase the freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.90,0:35:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready for the fight of your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.86,0:35:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care how many thousands\Nof Marines are waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.84,0:35:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to push right\Nthrough it, out to the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.94,0:35:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's now or never!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.84,0:35:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.34,0:35:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me to freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.84,0:35:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.82,0:35:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of sick joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.68,0:35:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a single-lady ship in sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.10,0:36:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But weren't we gonna steal one\Nof their ships to get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.70,0:36:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no guards, not even one Marine!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.10,0:36:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just as trapped as we always were!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.40,0:36:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair. What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.58,0:36:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The only option left is\Nto just wait here and
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.70,0:36:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,hope that Magellan kills\Nus mercifully and quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.60,0:36:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.51,0:36:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.00,0:36:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They got us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.20,0:36:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta give them credit for not being\Nas stupid as I thought they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.72,0:36:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The water around here is\Nfilled with giant sea kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.06,0:36:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As the saying goes, the Calm Belt is the\Ngreatest barrier protecting Impel Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.88,0:36:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We clawed our way out\Nof the depths of hell
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.06,0:36:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,with our merry fingernails\Njust for this! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.24,0:36:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're gonna get dragged right\Nback into the flames and be tortured!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.52,0:36:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to sit here moping!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.26,0:37:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the Navy's gone, but they only\Ncleared out because Magellan told them to.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.14,0:37:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're not far!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.24,0:37:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, and you can see the shadows\Nof their sails on the fog!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.92,0:37:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.58,0:37:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're still too far off!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.44,0:37:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we've got\Na chance of catching them!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.60,0:37:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's never too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.32,0:37:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got me here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.28,0:37:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand back and let me handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.36,0:37:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.94,0:37:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How freaking strong is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.74,0:37:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to keep moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.80,0:37:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hop on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.80,0:37:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.02,0:37:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.28,0:37:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.04,0:37:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's swimming like a shark\Nwith that thing when he's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.28,0:37:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's the true captain\Nof the Fishman Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.42,0:37:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, this is gonna be crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.08,0:37:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see how\Nthe Warlord's gonna fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.54,0:38:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention our savior\NCaptain Buggy right beside him!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.00,0:38:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help but feel\Na little hopeful here!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.26,0:38:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How stupid are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.74,0:38:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a hell of a lot safer\Nto stick with a warlord
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.14,0:38:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,than stay behind and try to\Nface Magellan on your own,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.96,0:38:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.10,0:38:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They're shooting!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.02,0:38:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like they smarted us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.30,0:38:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He dodged it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.52,0:38:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.64,0:38:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not just a fish man, that's\Nthe first son of the sea, Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.98,0:38:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All forces, open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.76,0:38:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we can sing Jinbe,\Nthe rest of them are finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.08,0:38:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.32,0:38:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,An entire fleet of ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.54,0:38:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna launch you guys on the\Ndeck, so hold on tight now! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.06,0:38:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.18,0:38:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You maybe wanna run that plan\Npast us one more time, fish face?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.64,0:38:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.55,0:38:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the bastard's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.14,0:39:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.78,0:39:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.78,0:39:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He left us here his bait\Nand scram off on his own!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.88,0:39:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitor, traitor, traitor, traitor,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.33,0:39:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell did you come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.04,0:39:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.95,0:39:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you leave us like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.60,0:39:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sending cops out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.94,0:39:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Jiu-Jitsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.64,0:39:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Warheart!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.16,0:39:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming straight forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.98,0:39:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ocean current, shoulder throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.84,0:40:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.86,0:40:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that water column?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.68,0:40:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's moving like it's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.52,0:40:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what's causing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.22,0:40:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the foggiest, but I\Ncan see people on the tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.06,0:40:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them's crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.28,0:40:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going to try to hijack the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.28,0:40:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.19,0:40:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack them with everything you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.66,0:40:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got Devil Fruit powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.68,0:40:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Just throw them in the water!
